tion/focused.py, 6913 bytes... wait, source_length 6913 and I saw a span [4591, 5283]. Let me read the whole thing.\n\nAlso need to see more of repository.py: __init__ (around 8142-9431), prepare fully (12688-17325 — partially seen; missing 14556-16655), _ChangeTool, authorize, check feedback handling, where source messages are appended (_source_messages usage), readiness, etc.\n\nAlso navigation.py in full: 14643 bytes; I've seen task_entry (partial, only docstring span 3625-3827 — actually the unit \"task_entry\" returned only signature+docstring? Span [3625, 3827] seems too short for a full function; probably the host selected a partial unit. Let me read navigation.py more fully: spans 0-3625 (imports, FIND/READ_UNIT/TASK_FIND definitions, NavigationPolicy), 3827-6149 (rest of task_entry + others), 6625-10999 (navigation_request, unit_read_request, acquire_candidates, task_selection?), 12595-14643 (end).\n\nAlso models.py for objective/effect definitions. And projection.py for request_bytes and project_request semantics. Let me be budget-conscious: max 10 action requests, 6 native acquisitions... hmm, \"up to 10 action requests, 6 native acquisition actions, 4 edit proposals, 3 applications (2 natural check feedback repairs).\" So I should plan reads carefully.\n\nPlan for reads (batch independent ones):\n1. Read focused.py in full (6913 bytes — one read of [0, 6913]).\n2. Read repository.py span [2762, 9346] (missing middle: _READ/_EDIT/_CHECK definitions, class definition start, __init__). That's ~6584 chars, fits in 8192 bytes? Text is mostly ASCII; should be fine.\n3. Read repository.py span [14556, 16655] (missing middle of prepare).\n4. Read repository.py span [17325, 26535] — that's 9210 chars, too big for one read (max 8192 bytes). Split: [17325, 22000], [22000, 26535].\n5. Read navigation.py spans: [0, 3625], [3827, 6149], [6625, 10999] (4374 chars OK), [12595, 14643].\n\nThat's a lot of reads. Total action requests: 10. Let me count: focused(1), repo mi